Bartka Królika!\n\nI wszyscy!\n\nI give it to you, say, that woman, that woman say\nI give it to you, that woman say\n\nI give it to you, that woman, that woman say\nI give it to you, that woman say\n\nI give it to you, say, that woman, that woman say\nI give it to you, that woman say\n\nI give it to you, that woman, that woman say\nI give it to you, that woman say\n\nI give it to you','\n',char(10)));
